PART 2 - DOWNLOADED ONLY WHEN THE PLAYER CLICKS "DOWNLOAD"
----------------------------------------------------------

These speech models are not part of the mod. They are downloaded from their
original publishers to config/wordsmith/models/ when the player chooses to,
and are checked against a SHA-256 hash stored in the mod.

